    <shortDescription>
      <Value><![CDATA[We’ve been using Envirotrax for over four years, and their team has consistently exceeded our expectations. The customer service is outstanding – they respond quickly and always address our concerns promptly. They also go above and beyond to work with us, modifying the information to meet our specific needs. The system itself is very user-friendly, making it easy to navigate and manage our data efficiently. It takes care of everything from ensuring reports are properly uploaded, to verifying that BPAT licenses are current, and test kits are calibrated annually. Thanks to Envirotrax, we can focus on our work with confidence, knowing the system efficiently handles these essential tasks . I highly recommend Envirotrax for any organization looking for a dependable, user-friendly database with exceptional customer support.]]></Value>
    </shortDescription>
    <title>
      <Value><![CDATA[Blanca Villanueva]]></Value>
    </title>
  </Properties>
